ision makes dark corridors navigable but drains batteries that must be found as the player goes.\n\nThere is no combat; encounters are about evasion, hiding in lockers and fleeing through vents. It is a single-player game with full controller support, intended for horror fans comfortable with intense, helpless tension and graphic content."}}